    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two things you are going to like",
     "texto": [
      "In Russian there are **no articles**: кот means «cat», «the cat» and «a cat».",
      "In the present tense there is **no verb «to be»**: **Он тут** word for word means «he here»: he is here.",
      "A note about stress: an **unstressed о sounds «a»**. That is why она (she) is said «ah-NAH» and окно (window) «ahk-NOH»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
